    "concept_3": {
      "id": "concept_3",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Equal powers can tell us ratios between exponents.\n\nIf 2^x = 4^y = 8^z, then:\n\n2^x = 2^(2y) = 2^(3z).\n\nSo x=2y=3z.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
